<title>UK: Glaxo Wellcome sees annual 1.2 bln stg R&amp;D.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Wellcome sees annual 1.2 bln stg R&amp;D.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glaxo Wellcome Plc said on Thursday that it expected its research and development (R&amp;D) spending to continue at the 1996 level of around 1.2 billion stg a year.</p>
<p>In a statement accompanying 1996 results, the company also said its operating profit margin last year rose to 37.5 percent of sales from 33.1 percent in 1995, benefiting from cost savings stemming from the merger of Glaxo and Wellcome in 1995.</p>
</text>
